      "description": "Dominican University Careers Careers JOIN OUR TEAM Position: BSB Office Assistant (undergraduate student worker) Location: River Forest, IL Job Id: 2370 # of Openings: 1 Title: BSB Office Assistant (undergraduate student worker) Department: Brennan School of Business Employment Type: Part-time, Hourly Dates: Fall 2026 Hourly Rate: $15.00 Number of positions available: 1-5 The Brennan School of Business is seeking a motivated student employee who would like to work in a professional office environment. Hours Needed: Monday: 8:30-10:30am Tuesday: 12:00-2:00pm Wednesday: 4:30-6:30pm Thursday: 12:00-2:00pm, 2:00-4:00pm, 4:30-6:30pm Friday: 3:00-5:00pm Principal Responsibilities: Greet and assist students, faculty, and other visitors to the office Provide front desk coverage as needed Prepare/copy/file documents Deliver and retrieve documents to and from other offices on campus Stock and maintain supplies Assist with BSB social media Perform other duties as requested, delegated or assigned. Qualifications: Telephone skills Strong interpersonal and organizational skills Basic computer skills including Microsoft Office Suite (Word and Excel) Ability to work independently and with others Requirements: Maintain a 3.0 or better GPA Must be currently enrolled in an undergraduate program at Dominican University Apply for this Position Go back to the job list powered by Dominican University | (708) 366-2490"
