      "title": "JOIN OUR TEAM",
      "description": "Dominican University Careers Careers JOIN OUR TEAM Position: Kids Klub Assistant Teacher Location: River Forest, IL Job Id: 2364 # of Openings: 1 TITLE: Kids Klub Assistant Teacher FLSA STATUS: Non-Exempt Hourly DEPARTMENT : St Giles Preschool, 1101 Columbian Ave., Oak Park, IL 60302 HOURLY RATE: $16.50 REPORTS TO: Kids Klub Supervisor and Director of Early Childhood HOURS NEEDED PER WEEK : Monday - Friday 7:00 - 9:00 am 2:00/3:00pm - 5:30/6:00pm Must be eligible for Federal Work Study PRIMARY PURPOSE/POSITION SUMMARY: To assist the classroom teacher in providing a warm, nurturing environment where children can grow physically, emotionally, and intellectually. EXPECTATIONS FOR ALL DOMINICAN EMPLOYEES: To support the University’s mission of preparing students to pursue truth, give compassionate service, and participate in creating a more just and humane world. JOB COMPONENTS/PRINCIPLE DUTIES AND RESPONSIBILITIES: Help teachers maintain a productive learning environment in the classroom. Help teachers maintain cleanliness in the classroom. Know where the students are at all times. Supervise indoor and outdoor play. Read and interact with students to promote learning. Demonstrate ability to use independent judgment and initiative to support children in learning and safety. Performs other duties as requested. QUALIFICATIONS: Knowledge, Skills, and Abilities: Basic knowledge of child development Flexibility Must be at least 18 years of age Apply for this Position Go back to the job list powered by Dominican University | (708) 366-2490"
