      "title": "JOIN OUR TEAM",
      "description": "Dominican University Careers Careers JOIN OUR TEAM Position: Student Worker- Office of the Registrar Location: River Forest, IL Job Id: 2367 # of Openings: 0 TITLE: Student Worker- Office of the Registrar FLSA: Hourly, 10 hours/week Available to: Undergraduate Students Hourly Rate: $15.00/hour The Office of the Registrar is seeking to hire student employees to assist in the department. Job Components A typical shift while working in the Office of the Registrar may include tasks such as: Filing Scanning Data Entry Proof Reading (Bulletin copy, reports, grade sheets etc.) Word processing (forms, letters, calendars, memos) Preparing Mailings Other general office work Knowledge, Skills and Abilities (requested/required) Keyboard knowledge and skills Attention to detail Ability to prioritize and work in fast-paced environment Professional and mature to ensure absolute confidentiality in working with sensitive data Must be eligible for US employment A background check is required for this position Apply for this Position Go back to the job list powered by Dominican University | (708) 366-2490"
